<title>USA: Rhodes shareholders OK Heilig-Meyers deal.</title>
<headline>Rhodes shareholders OK Heilig-Meyers deal.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rhodes Inc said its shareholders voted Monday to merge with Heilig-Meyers Co in a stock swap valued at about $175 million, including assumed debt.</p>
<p>Heilig-Meyers on September 17 offered Rhodes shareholders one share of its common stock for every two Rhodes shares.</p>
<p>The deal has been unamiously approved by the boards of both companies.</p>
<p>Rhodes said it expects the transaction to close December 31.</p>
</text>
